[ApiController,Route("api/educacao/merenda")] public sealed class EducacaoMerendaController:EducacaoAvancadaControllerBase{readonly IEducacaoMerendaService _service;public EducacaoMerendaController(IEducacaoMerendaService service,ICurrentTenant tenant,ICurrentUser user):base(tenant,user)=>_service=service;
